      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">When an angel gets behind a steering wheel</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;You know those anti-accident ads? The ones that warn you to stay attentive while driving. Yeah, the ones youâ€™re forced to watch while you learn to drive that you promptly ignore because itâ€™s common sense to look ahead while driving.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;What those donâ€™t prep you for are people who might as well be the second coming of Flash who have an affinity for jaywalking.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(aka the shoulder pop AU but make it seamista)&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
